1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:10,204
In August 2026, a catastrophic glacial flood tore through Langtang Valley, leaving over three hundred eighty tourists uncontactable and claiming thousands of lives.

2
00:00:10,154 --> 00:00:15,714
In steep Himalayan canyons, there is only one foot trail in, and one trail out.

3
00:00:15,714 --> 00:00:20,952
Today's government warning systems rely solely on physical river sensors downstream.

4
00:00:20,952 --> 00:00:28,416
Sirens sound only after bridges are already washing away, giving people ten minutes to scale vertical cliffs in the pitch dark.

5
00:00:28,416 --> 00:00:36,952
This is HimalSanket: an AI-powered multi-hazard early warning and autonomous rescue system built so the next search doesn't take eleven days.

